<h2>Step 8 — Summary, medical waiver &amp; sign-off</h2>
<label>Medical waiver?
  <select name="medical_waiver">
    <option value="">No</option>
    <option value="yes">Yes</option>
  </select>
</label>
<label>Medical waiver reason
  <textarea name="medical_waiver_reason" rows="3"></textarea>
</label>
<label>Electronic signature (typed)
  <input name="electronic_signature" />
</label>
<p>Review the captured data above and submit to generate the certificate.</p>
